# Changelog MarkNote

## 1.0.0 - 07/10/2026

Ban dau tien.

- Tao/sua/xoa note Markdown, luu vao SQLite (FTS5).
- Gan/go tag, tao tag moi.
- Xem truoc song song, chon theme CSS (default, github, dark).
- Dong bo cuon giua editor va preview.
- Tim trong note, thay the trong note.
- Tim toan kho ket hop loc tag.
- Xuat HTML va PDF dung chung mot theme.
- Cai dat qua `make install`, goi phan phoi `marknote-1.0.tar.gz`.